        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Tingkum heisan ningmei ntau luai the,",
            "Neikhat namu neila duango jianmei nun;",
            "Ntau hei kagan guang tang the,",
            "Lungchang phungnipui gan guangtang puthe.",
            "",
            "Chorus:",
            "He jianmei guai le guang kariu o,",
            "Asei hei chunsi pui gan guangtang the;",
            "Ngammei kam neilalou o jianmmei nun,",
            "Njianmei arup nun thiu le.",
            "",
            "2. Njianmei nun le neila nduang o,",
            "Matat khat nasini pat lou ri o;",
            "Simei %&6 lung ti rianra lou,",
            "Lung neila khang poubaumei khounei o.",
            "",
            "3. Guang ntang lou tucho njianmei nun,",
            "Poubaumei jaujian %&6 ariu dat ni;",
            "Han guang dat nu ni tuang ram the,",
            "Chamdan luailou ngamthe kapumma ta.",
            "",
            "4. Njianmei nun le ntam kandih khou,",
            "Ata pat lou tho njianmei nun le;",
            "Ntammei hei nai dat mak khang,",
            "Poubaumei tan nthuknga tan di kho."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
